# 🚀 FlowBoard

A full-stack SaaS project management platform inspired by **Linear** and **Notion**, built for teams to manage projects, track issues, and collaborate in real time.

🌐 **Live Demo:** https://flowboard.space
Note: The backend is hosted on Render's free tier and may take around 30–60 seconds to wake up after inactivity.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## ✨ Features

### 🔐 Authentication
* Email & Password Authentication
* OTP Email Verification
* Google OAuth
* JWT Authentication (HTTP-only Cookies)
* Refresh Token Rotation
* Forgot Password
* Change Password
* Change Email

### 👥 Workspace Management
* Create & Manage Workspaces
* Invite Members via Email
* Role-Based Access Control (Owner / Admin / Member)

### 📁 Projects
* Create & Manage Projects
* Emoji Project Icons
* GitHub Repository Linking

### 📝 Issue Tracking
* Create, Update & Assign Issues
* Priority Levels (Low / Medium / High)
* Status Management (Todo / In Progress / Done)

### 🔔 Real-time Notifications
* Live Notifications with Socket.io
* Unread Notification Count
* Mark All as Read

### 🔗 GitHub Integration
* Connect GitHub Account
* Link Repositories
* Receive Push & Pull Request Notifications via Webhooks

### 📜 Activity Log
* Workspace-level Audit Trail
* Track Important Actions

### 🎨 Theme Support
* Dark / Light Mode
* System Preference Support

### 🔑 OTP Flows
* Signup Verification
* Forgot Password
* Change Password
* Change Email

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🛠 Tech Stack

## Backend
* Node.js
* TypeScript
* Express.js
* Prisma ORM
* PostgreSQL (Neon)
* Redis (Upstash)
* Socket.io
* BullMQ
* JWT Authentication
* Google OAuth
* GitHub OAuth
* Cloudinary
* Resend
* Docker & Docker Compose

## Frontend
* React
* TypeScript
* Vite
* Tailwind CSS v4
* shadcn/ui
* Redux Toolkit
* TanStack Query
* React Hook Form
* Zod
* Axios
* React Router

