# 🏗 Architecture Highlights

## 🔐 Authentication
* JWT Access Token (15 min)
* Refresh Token Rotation (7 Days)
* HTTP-only Secure Cookies
* Axios Refresh Queue (Prevents Multiple Refresh Requests)
* Google OAuth (Firebase)
* GitHub OAuth

## 📧 OTP System (Redis)
* Layered Redis Architecture
* Bcrypt Hashed OTP Storage
* 5 Minute Expiration
* Maximum 5 Verification Attempts
* Generic & Type-safe OTP Verification

## ⚡ Real-time Communication
* Socket.io Authentication using JWT Cookies
* Personal User Rooms
* Workspace Rooms
* Multi-device Support
* Automatic Reconnection

## 🔔 Notifications
* Database-backed Notifications
* Cursor-based Pagination
* Real-time Updates
* Infinite Scrolling
* Optimistic Cache Updates using TanStack Query

## 🔗 GitHub Integration
* Secure OAuth Flow
* Repository Linking
* HMAC-SHA256 Webhook Verification
* BullMQ Background Processing
* Pull Request & Push Event Notifications

## 🛡 Permission System
* Workspace-level RBAC
* Owner / Admin / Member Roles
* Backend Authorization Middleware
* Frontend Permission Helpers
* Defense-in-depth Security

## 🗄 Database
* Prisma ORM
* PostgreSQL
* Cascade Deletes
* Composite Unique Constraints
* Cursor-based Pagination

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

