# 🚀 Local Development

## Prerequisites
* Node.js 20+
* Docker & Docker Compose
* GitHub OAuth App
* Firebase Project
* Cloudinary Account
* Resend Account

## Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/tejasdarode17/Flowboard.git

cd Flowboard

docker compose up --build

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

